{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2022-07-28 09:00:00', 'title': 'REGIONS BANK RECOGNIZED AS A “BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION”', 'text': 'BIRMINGHAM, ALA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #DEI22--REGIONS BANK IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT IT HAS RECEIVED THE HIGHEST POSSIBLE SCORE OF 100 ON THE 2022 DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX® (DEI), THE LEADING NONPROFIT RESOURCE FOR BUSINESS DISABILITY INCLUSION WORLDWIDE. REGIONS HAS BEEN NAMED A “BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION” FOR THE SECOND YEAR IN A ROW. THE DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX WAS LAUNCHED IN 2015 BY DISABILITY:IN AND THE AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES (AAPD) AND IS ACKNOWLEDGE'}